{"title":"Career roadmap · Space Planner","role":"Space Planner","summary":"A Space Planner develops efficient, functional and visually coherent layouts for residential, commercial, retail, hospitality, workplace, healthcare, educational and public environments. The role combines interior design, spatial planning, human behaviour, building standards, circulation, furniture planning, CAD/BIM, sustainability, accessibility and client requirements.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)"},"about":[{"label":"Design pathway","text":"Interior Design"},{"label":"Primary foundation","text":"Interior design + spatial planning + CAD/BIM + building knowledge"},{"label":"Typical entry route","text":"Interior Design Intern → Junior Interior Designer / Space Planning Assistant → Space Planner → Senior Space Planner → Design Lead / Workplace or Interior Design Manager"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build spatial-design, drafting, CAD, materials and portfolio fundamentals"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Work on real projects and develop expertise in workplace, retail, hospitality, residential or another sector"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Lead complex space-planning projects and coordinate architects, engineers, vendors and clients"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Combine spatial strategy with BIM, sustainability, data, smart buildings, AI and human-centred design"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Interior Design","Spatial Design Internship","Junior Interior Designer / Space Planning Assistant","Space Planner","Senior Space Planner","Design Lead / Workplace Strategy or Interior Design Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"The B.Des provides a strong foundation. However, students should supplement design education with technical drawing, building services, codes, accessibility, ergonomics and BIM, because professional space planning involves much more than visual styling."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals, observation, scale and proportion"},{"text":"Interior-design studio"},{"text":"Room-layout studies"},{"text":"Spatial fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Drafting, ergonomics and basic space planning"},{"text":"Technical drawing projects"},{"text":"Annotated floor plans"},{"text":"Technical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"AutoCAD/2D drafting and furniture planning"},{"text":"CAD exercises"},{"text":"Complete residential/commercial plan"},{"text":"Technical execution"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"3D modelling, materials and lighting"},{"text":"SketchUp/Revit/other tools"},{"text":"3D spatial model"},{"text":"Digital spatial design"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Building systems, codes, accessibility and services"},{"text":"Real project documentation"},{"text":"Detailed commercial layout"},{"text":"Professional readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship and multidisciplinary coordination"},{"text":"Interior/architecture practice"},{"text":"Internship + project documentation"},{"text":"Industry experience"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced space planning and sector specialisation"},{"text":"Major design studio"},{"text":"3–5 detailed case studies"},{"text":"Professional capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Portfolio, client presentation and job preparation"},{"text":"Live/freelance project"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship/work evidence"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful software ecosystems include Autodesk and Autodesk Revit.","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/"},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical and design stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Spatial planning fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Zoning"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Adjacencies"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Human dimensions"},{"text":"Furniture layouts"},{"text":"Functional relationships"},{"text":"Spatial hierarchy"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Wayfinding"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Flexibility"},{"text":"Future expansion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good space planner should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who uses the space, what do they need to do, how do they move through it, and how can the available area support those activities efficiently?"}]},{"heading":"Ergonomics and human factors","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Anthropometrics"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Human movement"},{"text":"Reach zones"},{"text":"Workstation dimensions"},{"text":"Seating"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Visual comfort"},{"text":"Acoustic comfort"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"User behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Apply these principles to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offices"},{"text":"Homes"},{"text":"Retail stores"},{"text":"Hotels"},{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Public spaces"}]}]},{"heading":"Technical drawing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Furniture layouts"},{"text":"Reflected ceiling plans"},{"text":"Flooring plans"},{"text":"Lighting layouts"},{"text":"Joinery drawings"},{"text":"Material plans"},{"text":"Dimensioning"},{"text":"Annotation"},{"text":"Drawing standards"},{"text":"Construction details"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A space planner should be able to convert a concept into clear technical documentation that another professional can understand and execute."}]},{"heading":"CAD and BIM","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop proficiency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino or equivalent"},{"text":"3D visualisation tools"},{"text":"Rendering workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["2D CAD","3D modelling","BIM","coordinated project documentation"]},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term employability, BIM knowledge can become particularly valuable for larger commercial and multidisciplinary projects."}]},{"heading":"Building systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the basics of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Electrical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Power points"},{"text":"Load awareness"},{"text":"Switches"},{"text":"Emergency lighting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HVAC"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air-conditioning zones"},{"text":"Air circulation"},{"text":"Equipment requirements"},{"text":"Ceiling coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Plumbing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wet areas"},{"text":"Water supply"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Fixture locations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fire and life safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency exits"},{"text":"Escape routes"},{"text":"Fire equipment"},{"text":"Occupant movement"},{"text":"Egress principles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The space planner does not replace the licensed engineer or fire-safety professional. The objective is to coordinate design decisions intelligently with specialist disciplines."}]},{"heading":"Accessibility and inclusive design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accessible circulation"},{"text":"Ramps"},{"text":"Door clearances"},{"text":"Accessible toilets"},{"text":"Wheelchair movement"},{"text":"Visual accessibility"},{"text":"Tactile guidance"},{"text":"Inclusive furniture planning"},{"text":"Universal design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use the applicable Indian building/accessibility requirements and current local regulations for actual projects."}]},{"heading":"Materials and finishes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flooring"},{"text":"Wall finishes"},{"text":"Ceiling systems"},{"text":"Wood"},{"text":"Stone"},{"text":"Ceramic"},{"text":"Glass"},{"text":"Metal"},{"text":"Laminates"},{"text":"Fabrics"},{"text":"Acoustic materials"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate materials based on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cost","durability","maintenance","safety","aesthetics","environmental impact","application"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Lighting design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ambient lighting"},{"text":"Task lighting"},{"text":"Accent lighting"},{"text":"Daylighting"},{"text":"Colour temperature"},{"text":"Glare"},{"text":"Shadows"},{"text":"Light distribution"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create lighting concepts for different spaces."}]},{"heading":"Sustainability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passive design"},{"text":"Daylight optimisation"},{"text":"Natural ventilation"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"},{"text":"Low-impact materials"},{"text":"Recycled materials"},{"text":"Local materials"},{"text":"Water efficiency"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Material life cycle"},{"text":"Adaptive reuse"},{"text":"Circular design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Sustainability should become a design constraint and decision-making framework, not simply an aesthetic theme."}]},{"heading":"Sector-specific space planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Choose at least one major specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Workplace"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workstations"},{"text":"Meeting rooms"},{"text":"Collaboration spaces"},{"text":"Focus rooms"},{"text":"Hybrid work"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Employee experience"},{"text":"Occupancy planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retail"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer flow"},{"text":"Product display"},{"text":"Store zoning"},{"text":"Visual merchandising"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Back-of-house"},{"text":"Conversion-oriented layouts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest circulation"},{"text":"Rooms"},{"text":"Lobby"},{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Back-of-house"},{"text":"Service circulation"},{"text":"Experience design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient flow"},{"text":"Staff circulation"},{"text":"Infection-control principles"},{"text":"Waiting areas"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Clinical adjacencies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Healthcare planning requires specialised knowledge and multidisciplinary coordination."},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Classrooms"},{"text":"Laboratories"},{"text":"Libraries"},{"text":"Collaborative learning"},{"text":"Student circulation"},{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Residential"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Living areas"},{"text":"Kitchens"},{"text":"Bedrooms"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Family movement"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Furniture planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Space-planning workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to follow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Client Brief"},{"type":"h","text":"Site/Existing-Space Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"User & Activity Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Area Programme"},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacency Matrix"},{"type":"h","text":"Bubble Diagram"},{"type":"h","text":"Zoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Concept Layout"},{"type":"h","text":"Furniture Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Circulation Check"},{"type":"h","text":"Code/Accessibility Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Services Coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Cost/Feasibility Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Client Approval"},{"type":"h","text":"Execution Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"This workflow should become second nature by graduation."},{"type":"h","text":"Data and workplace analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"For commercial space planning, learn basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Occupancy analysis"},{"text":"Utilisation rates"},{"text":"Headcount planning"},{"text":"Desk ratios"},{"text":"Meeting-room utilisation"},{"text":"Space-per-person calculations"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a valuable combination:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Design","Spatial Planning","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI for space planning"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Early layout concepts"},{"text":"Design alternatives"},{"text":"Mood boards"},{"text":"Material exploration"},{"text":"Image generation"},{"text":"Furniture alternatives"},{"text":"Space-programme analysis"},{"text":"Occupancy scenarios"},{"text":"Design documentation assistance"},{"text":"Rendering variations"},{"text":"Client presentation concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, human professionals remain responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Measurements"},{"text":"Structural feasibility"},{"text":"Building codes"},{"text":"Fire/life safety"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Engineering coordination"},{"text":"Construction feasibility"},{"text":"Final technical decisions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future space planner should use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brief","Data","AI-assisted alternatives","Human spatial judgement","Technical validation","Final design"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"A weak portfolio:"},{"type":"p","text":"Attractive interior renders with little explanation."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Space Planner portfolio demonstrates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brief","User analysis","Area programme","Adjacency","Zoning","Plan","Circulation","Furniture","Materials","3D","Technical drawings","Final outcome"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–8 detailed case studies."},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Small residential apartment"},{"text":"Modern office"},{"text":"Retail store"},{"text":"Café/restaurant"},{"text":"Hotel or hospitality space"},{"text":"Educational facility"},{"text":"Healthcare/wellness facility"},{"text":"Co-working space"},{"text":"Sustainable adaptive-reuse project"},{"text":"Data-driven workplace planning project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-year honours / advanced variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If an honours/research pathway is available, use the additional depth for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workplace strategy"},{"text":"Healthcare design"},{"text":"Sustainable interiors"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Smart buildings"},{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Environmental psychology"},{"text":"Design research"},{"text":"Universal accessibility"},{"text":"Building performance"},{"text":"Spatial analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be deeper technical and strategic capability, not simply additional certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Space Planner specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Workplace Planning"},{"text":"BIM + ergonomics + occupancy analytics"},{"text":"Workplace Strategy Lead"}],[{"text":"Retail Planning"},{"text":"Customer flow + merchandising + branding"},{"text":"Retail Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Hospitality"},{"text":"Guest experience + interiors + services"},{"text":"Hospitality Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Patient flow + accessibility + healthcare standards"},{"text":"Healthcare Planner"}],[{"text":"Residential"},{"text":"Interior design + furniture + client management"},{"text":"Senior Interior Designer"}],[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Learning environments + safety + accessibility"},{"text":"Education Design Specialist"}],[{"text":"Commercial Interiors"},{"text":"CAD + BIM + documentation"},{"text":"Senior Space Planner"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Interiors"},{"text":"Materials + energy + circular design"},{"text":"Sustainable Design Lead"}],[{"text":"BIM/Technical Planning"},{"text":"Revit + documentation + coordination"},{"text":"BIM Interior Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Workplace Analytics"},{"text":"Space planning + Excel/Power BI + occupancy data"},{"text":"Workplace Strategy Consultant"}],[{"text":"Smart Buildings"},{"text":"IoT + sensors + BIM + building data"},{"text":"Smart Workplace Specialist"}],[{"text":"Experiential Spaces"},{"text":"Spatial storytelling + branding + installations"},{"text":"Experience Design Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Space planning will increasingly move toward data-driven and technology-enabled environments."},{"type":"p","text":"Future capabilities should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Occupancy analytics"},{"text":"Smart-building systems"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Climate-responsive interiors"},{"text":"Universal design"},{"text":"Workplace analytics"},{"text":"AR/VR design review"},{"text":"AI-assisted planning"},{"text":"Building-performance data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","Technical Knowledge","Data","Sustainability","Technology","Huma