, measurements, drawings, client meetings, vendor coordination and construction documentation, rather than only rendering work."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"2D technical drawings"}],[{"text":"Revit/BIM"},{"text":"Professional building documentation"}],[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"3D spatial modelling"}],[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Advanced 3D/form development"}],[{"text":"3D rendering"},{"text":"Visual communication"}],[{"text":"Interior lighting"},{"text":"Technical design knowledge"}],[{"text":"Sustainable design"},{"text":"Future-focused practice"}],[{"text":"Universal/accessibility design"},{"text":"Inclusive environments"}],[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Delivery capability"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Area/budget/space calculations"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Workplace/spatial analytics"}],[{"text":"BIM coordination"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary projects"}],[{"text":"Workplace strategy"},{"text":"Corporate space planning"}],[{"text":"Building performance"},{"text":"Sustainable planning"}],[{"text":"AI for design"},{"text":"Emerging workflows"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should support real project capability. A strong technical portfolio generally matters more than collecting many certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior Design Intern"},{"text":"Space Planning Intern"},{"text":"Junior Interior Designer"},{"text":"Space Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Interior Design Assistant"},{"text":"CAD Designer"},{"text":"Junior CAD Designer"},{"text":"BIM Interior Design Assistant"},{"text":"Design Coordinator — Junior"},{"text":"Workplace Design Assistant"},{"text":"Retail Design Assistant"},{"text":"Furniture Layout Designer"},{"text":"Junior 3D Visualiser"},{"text":"Interior Design Executive"},{"text":"Design Documentation Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Progression roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space Planner"},{"text":"Interior Designer"},{"text":"Senior Space Planner"},{"text":"Senior Interior Designer"},{"text":"Workplace Strategist"},{"text":"Design Coordinator"},{"text":"BIM Coordinator"},{"text":"Project Designer"},{"text":"Design Lead"},{"text":"Workplace Design Lead"},{"text":"Interior Design Manager"},{"text":"Design Manager"}]},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Junior Interior Designer"},{"text":"CAD + plans + materials"},{"text":"Interior portfolio"}],[{"text":"Space Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Planning + CAD + furniture layouts"},{"text":"Space-planning case study"}],[{"text":"CAD Designer"},{"text":"AutoCAD + technical drawing"},{"text":"Drawing portfolio"}],[{"text":"BIM Assistant"},{"text":"Revit + documentation"},{"text":"BIM model"}],[{"text":"Workplace Design Assistant"},{"text":"Space planning + ergonomics"},{"text":"Office-planning project"}],[{"text":"Retail Design Assistant"},{"text":"Customer flow + merchandising"},{"text":"Retail case study"}],[{"text":"Space Planner"},{"text":"Planning + technical + coordination"},{"text":"Multiple real/project cases"}],[{"text":"Workplace Strategist"},{"text":"Space planning + data + business"},{"text":"Occupancy/workplace analytics project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"The title Space Planner can be entry-level in some organisations, but larger consultancies may hire graduates as Junior Interior Designers, Space Planning Assistants, CAD/BIM Designers or Design Coordinators first."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory for space planning. Professional experience and technical competence are highly valuable."},{"type":"table","header":["PG option","Us