ding, Fulbright"},{"text":"Portfolio + programme eligibility"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"RCA, UAL, Kingston and relevant design schools"},{"text":"University funding, Chevening where applicable"},{"text":"Portfolio + academic requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Relevant public design/architecture institutions"},{"text":"DAAD"},{"text":"Programme language + eligibility"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"TU Delft/design institutions and relevant programmes"},{"text":"University/institutional funding"},{"text":"Portfolio + programme fit"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"OCAD University and relevant institutions"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio + eligibility"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"RMIT and relevant design schools"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio + English"}],[{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"Design/architecture institutions"},{"text":"MEXT"},{"text":"Language + programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Switzerland"},{"text":"Relevant architecture/design schools"},{"text":"Institutional funding"},{"text":"Portfolio + academic requirements"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spatial-design portfolio"},{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Sections/elevations"},{"text":"3D models"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"Space-programming diagrams"},{"text":"Sustainability projects"},{"text":"Research/project statement"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"Recommendations"},{"text":"English-language test where required"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For scholarships, start with official sources such as DAAD India and USIEF.","url":"https://www.daad.in/en/"},{"type":"note","label":"Verify","text":"programme accreditation, professional eligibility, portfolio requirements, fees, deadlines, scholarships and visa/post-study-work rules."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Interior Design Student","Interior/Space Planning Intern","Junior Interior Designer / Space Planning Assistant","Space Planner","Senior Space Planner","Design Lead / Workplace Strategist","Design Manager / Workplace Strategy Manager","Design Director / Head of Workplace or Interiors"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative long-term paths"},{"type":"p","text":"A Space Planner can move into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior Design"},{"text":"Workplace Strategy"},{"text":"Retail Design"},{"text":"Hospitality Design"},{"text":"Healthcare Planning"},{"text":"BIM Management"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Facility Planning"},{"text":"Real Estate Development"},{"text":"Workplace Analytics"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Smart-Building Consulting"},{"text":"Urban/Spatial Design"},{"text":"Design Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future Space Planner will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spatial Design","BIM","Building Knowledge","Data Analytics","Sustainability","Human Behaviour","AI","Smart-Building Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The profession will increasingly shift from simply drawing floor plans to understanding how people, buildings, technology and organisations interact within physical space."}]}]}